,"choice_id":"","source_cn":"最近我可收集到了不少有意思的<style=highli...","textdes_id":"","document_page_count":"","document_title_cn":"","document_order":"","document_object_id":"","document_item_id":"","document_icon":"","document_image_icon":"","document_base_image":"","document_pic":"","document_gender":""},"say:4:1631702004:1":{"key":"say:4:1631702004:1","kind":"say","source_node_id":"4","source_node_type":"__DT.ActionNode","statementID":"1631702004","action_index":"1","choice_index":"","choice_id":"","source_cn":"每一个都独特得能写进《魔法医学异闻典籍》！而我，天才般...","textdes_id":"","document_page_count":"","document_title_cn":"","document_order":"","document_object_id":"","document_item_id":"","document_icon":"","document_image_icon":"","document_base_image":"","document_pic":"","document_gender":""},"choice_prompt:5:1631702004":{"key":"choice_prompt:5:1631702004","kind":"choice_prompt","source_node_id":"5","source_node_type":"__DT.MultiChooseNode","statementID":"1631702004","action_index":"","choice_index":"","choice_id":"","source_cn":"每一个都独特得能写进《魔法医学异闻典籍》！而我，天才般的扎卡医生，已经为他们<style=highlight>量身定制了药方</style>！怎么样，有兴趣听听吗？","textdes_id":"","document_page_count":"","document_title_cn":"","document_order":"","document_object_id":"","document_item_id":"","document_icon":"","document_image_icon":"","document_base_image":"","document_pic":"","document_gender":""},"say:6:1631702005:1":{"key":"say:6:1631702005:1","kind":"say","source_node_id":"6","source_node_type":"__DT.ActionNode","statementID":"1631702005","action_index":"1","choice_index":"","choice_id":"","source_cn":"不错，有成为医生的潜质！","textdes_id":"","document_page_count":"","document_title_cn":"","document_order":"","document_object_id":"","document_item_id":"","document_icon":"","document_image_icon":"","document_base_image":"","document_pic":"","document_gender":""},"say:7:1631702008:1":{"key":"say:7:1631702008:1","kind":"say","source_node_id":"7","source_node_type":"__DT.ActionNode","statementID":"1631702008","action_index":"1","choice_index":"","choice_id":"","source_cn":"顺便再把这几个药方也一并记下吧，保不齐你也能用上。","textdes_id":"","document_page_count":"","document_title_cn":"","document_order":"","document_object_id":"","document_item_id":"","document_icon":"","document_image_icon":"","document_base_image":"","document_pic":"","document_gender":""},"say:8:1631702009:0":{"key":"say:8:1631702009:0","kind":"say","source_node_id":"8","source_node_type":"__DT.ActionNode","statementID":"1631702009","action_index":"0","choice_index":"","choice_id":"","source_cn":"这第一个病患，是一名<style=highlight>...","textdes_id":"","document_page_count":"","document_title_cn":"","document_order":"","document_object_id":"","document_item_id":"","document_icon":"","document_image_icon":"","document_base_image":"","document_pic":"","document_gender":""},"document:9:301:0":{"key":"document:9:301:0","kind":"document","source_node_id":"9","source_node_type":"__DT.ActionNode","statementID":"","action_index":"0","choice_index":"","choice_id":"","source_cn":"药剂配方：\n\n写作论文、提交方案、撰写汇报……工作与生活中总是面临着无数的修改与返工。轻则令人头痛不已，重则让人崩溃狂躁。\n如果患者只是<style=\"highlight\">头痛难安</style>，\n可给予<link=PharmacyTextMedianTips><u>适量</u></link><style=\"highlight\">香甜六角葵</style>，配以<link=PharmacyTextMedianTips><u>适量</u></link><style=\"highlight\">提神苦果</style>，最后加以<link=PharmacyTextLittleTips><u>少许</u></link><style=\"highlight\">冰心石</style>，\n调制出的<style=\"highlight\">三修四改止痛药</style>，可以让患者充分得以冷静的同时打起精神。\n\n上述药材，均需要以<style=\"highlight\">小火</style>徐徐熬煮，才能充分发挥药效。\n无论你是写作论文的学生，还是修改方案的设计师，来上一份药剂试试看吧！","textdes_id":"301","document_page_count":"1","document_title_cn":"返工冷静剂（一）","document_order":"1","document_object_id":"0","document_item_id":"4801778","document_icon":"UI/Icon/Item/item_quest_mapstory_item4.png","document_image_icon":"","document_base_image":"UI/Prefabs/StoryReadItem/items/pbui_map_story_detail_item4.prefab","document_pic":"","document_gender":"false"},"say:10:1631702010:1":{"key":"say:10:1631702010:1","kind":"say","source_node_id":"10","source_node_type":"__DT.ActionNode","statementID":"1631702010","action_index":"1","choice_index":"","choice_id":"","source_cn":"第二个病患是一名<style=highlight>念叨...","textdes_id":"","document_page_count":"","document_title_cn":"","document_order":"","document_object_id":"","document_item_id":"","document_icon":"","document_image_icon":"","document_base_image":"","document_pic":"","document_gender":""},"document:11:302:0":{"key":"document:11:302:0","kind":"document","source_node_id":"11","source_node_type":"__DT.ActionNode","statementID":"","action_index":"0","choice_index":"","choice_id":"","source_cn":"药剂配方：\n\n写作论文、提交方案、撰写汇报……工作与生活中总是面临着无数的修改与返工。轻则令人头痛不已，重则让人崩溃狂躁。\n若是患者已然<style=\"highlight\">陷入狂躁</style>，\n建议先给<link=PharmacyTextLittleTips><u>少许</u></link><style=\"highlight\">香甜六角葵</style>，辅以<link=PharmacyTextLargeTips><u>大量</u></link><style=\"highlight\">提神苦果</style>，最后，需要<link=PharmacyTextLittleTips><u>少许</u></link><style=\"highlight\">冰心石</style>，\n由此制成<style=\"highlight\">百修百改冷静剂</style>，药效不仅提神醒脑，更能令人心平气和。\n\n上述药材，均需要以<style=\"highlight\">小火</style>徐徐熬煮，才能充分发挥药效。\n无论你是写作论文的学生，还是修改方案的设计师，来上一份药剂试试看吧！","textdes_id":"302","document_page_count":"1","document_title_cn":"返工冷静剂（二）","document_order":"1","document_object_id":"0","document_item_id":"4801779","document_icon":"UI/Icon/Item/item_quest_mapstory_item4.png","document_image_icon":"","document_base_image":"UI/Prefabs/StoryReadItem/items/pbui_map_story_detail_item4.prefab","document_pic":"","document_gender":"false"},"say:12:1631702011:1":{"key":"say:12:1631702011:1","kind":"say","source_node_id":"12","source_node_type":"__DT.ActionNode","statementID":"1631702011","action_index":"1","choice_index":"","choice_id":"","source_cn":"第三个病患是一名<style=highlight>拖拖...","textdes_id":"","document_page_count":"","document_title_cn":"","document_order":"","document_object_id":"","document_item_id":"","document_icon":"","document_image_icon":"","document_base_image":"","document_pic":"","document_gender":""},"document:13:303:0":{"key":"document:13:303:0","kind":"document","source_node_id":"13","source_node_type":"__DT.ActionNode","statementID":"","action_index":"0","choice_index":"","choice_id":"","source_cn":"药剂配方：\n\n一旦准备做正事就忍不住东摸摸西摸摸？不到最后期限就无法开工？相信我，这是连某位不愿具名的沙利叶大人都头痛不已的问题！\n对于<style=\"highlight\">容易走神，难以专注</style>的患者，\n首先当然需要<link=PharmacyTextLittleTips><u>少许</u></link><style=\"highlight\">冰心石</style>，再加足了<link=PharmacyTextLargeTips><u>大量</u></link><style=\"highlight\">灵感萤瓤果</style>，最后加以<link=PharmacyTextLittleTips><u>少许</u></link><style=\"highlight\">火辣跳跳豆</style>，\n以此萃取而出的<style=\"highlight\">专心致志口服液</style>，便能有效地让患者灵感不断，集中精神，提升效率！\n\n上述药材，需要以<style=\"highlight\">大火</style>猛炖，才能充分释放药效！\n如果你也被上述病症所困扰，无法充分投身于自己热爱的工作，那就试试看上述配方吧！","textdes_id":"303","document_page_count":"1","document_title_cn":"高效萃取液（一）","document_order":"1","document_object_id":"0","document_item_id":"4801780","document_icon":"UI/Icon/Item/item_quest_mapstory_item4.png","document_image_icon":"","document_base_image":"UI/Prefabs/StoryReadItem/items/pbui_map_story_detail_item4.prefab","document_pic":"","document_gender":"false"},"say:14:1631702012:0":{"key":"say:14:1631702012:0","kind":"say","source_node_id":"14","source_node_type":"__DT.ActionNode","statementID":"1631702012","action_index":"0","choice_index":"","choice_id":"","source_cn":"对了，还有那个<style=highlight>躺在地...","textdes_id":"","document_page_count":"","document_title_cn":"","document_order":"","document_object_id":"","document_item_id":"","document_icon":"","document_image_icon":"","document_base_image":"","document_pic":"","document_gender":""},"document:15:304:0":{"key":"document:15:304:0","kind":"document","source_node_id":"15","source_node_type":"__DT.ActionNode","statementID":"","action_index":"0","choice_index":"","choice_id":"","source_cn":"药剂配方：\n\n一旦准备做正事就忍不住东摸摸西摸摸？不到最后期限就无法开工？相信我，这是连某位不愿具名的沙利叶大人都头痛不已的问题！\n如果患者已然<style=\"highlight\">懒散躺平，纹丝不动</style>，\n那就需要先加入<link=PharmacyTextMedianTips><u>适量</u></link><style=\"highlight\">冰心石</style>，再辅以<link=PharmacyTextLittleTips><u>少许</u></link><style=\"highlight\">灵感萤瓤果</style>，最后加入<link=PharmacyTextMedianTips><u>适量</u></link>的<style=\"highlight\">火辣跳跳豆</style>，\n以此萃取而出的<style=\"highlight\">即刻开工兴奋剂</style>，便能有效地促进患者不再拖延，立即开始行动！\n\n上述药材，需要以<style=\"highlight\">大火</style>猛炖，才能充分释放药效！\n如果你也被上述病症所困扰，无法充分投身于自己热爱的工作，那就试试看上述配方吧！","textdes_id":"304","document_page_count":"1","document_title_cn":"高效萃取液（二）","document_order":"1","document_object_id":"0","document_item_id":"4801781","document_icon":"UI/Icon/Item/item_quest_mapstory_item4.png","document_image_icon":"","document_base_image":"UI/Prefabs/StoryReadItem/items/pbui_map_story_detail_item4.prefab","document_pic":"","document_gender":"false"},"say:16:1631702013:1":{"key":"say:16:1631702013:1","kind":"say","source_node_id":"16","source_node_type":"__DT.ActionNode","statementID":"1631702013","action_index":"1","choice_index":"","choice_id":"","source_cn":"怎么样，这些病症你没听过吧？既然你都知道药方了，再替我...","textdes_id":"","document_page_count":"","document_title_cn":"","document_order":"","document_object_id":"","document_item_id":"","document_icon":"","document_image_icon":"","document_base_image":"","document_pic":"","document_gender":""},"choice_prompt:17:1631702013":{"key":"choice_prompt:17:1631702013","kind":"choice_prompt","source_node_id":"17","source_node_type":"__DT.MultiChooseNode","statementID":"1631702013","action_index":"","choice_index":"","choice_id":"","source_cn":"怎么样，这些病症你没听过吧？既然你都知道药方了，再替我把药带给他们好了！","textdes_id":"","document_page_count":"","document_title_cn":"","document_order":"","document_object_id":"","document_item_id":"","document_icon":"","document_image_icon":"","document_base_image":"","document_pic":"","document_gender":""},"say:18:1631702014:1":{"key":"say:18:1631702014:1","kind":"say","source_node_id":"18","source_node_type":"__DT.ActionNode","statementID":"1631702014","action_index":"1","choice_index":"","choice_id":"","source_cn":"咳咳，这药物嘛，尚在测试阶段，我，专业的扎卡先生，可不...","textdes_id":"","document_page_count":"","document_title_cn":"","document_order":"","document_object_id":"","docume